{
  "$comment": "MYELIN Vault policy (generated by `myelin init`; ADR-0002 D5/D6). Edit(...) denies cover Write/Edit/NotebookEdit. The MYELIN plugin Guard hooks are the primary enforcement; these rules are the fallback. Personal overrides go to settings.local.json (git-ignored).",
